<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 209,329 bags in last week.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 209,329 bags in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia cocoa arrivals were 209,329 bags in the week ending September 15 compared to 25,729 bags the previous week and 28,066 bags in the corresponding week last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said.</p>
<p>This brought total arrivals for the 1996/97 crop to 1,643,435 bags.</p>
<p>The cumulative total at this stage of the 1995/96 crop was 964,469 bags and 1,579,175 bags in the 1994/95 crop.</p>
<p>-- Brian Homewood, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
